text CeladonCity_DepartmentStore_2F_Text_SuperRepelMorePowerfulRepel {
    "Super Repel keeps weak Pokémon at\n"
    "bay…\p"
    "Hmm, it's a more powerful Repel.$"
}

text CeladonCity_DepartmentStore_2F_Text_BuyReviveForLongOutings {
    "For long outings, you should buy\n"
    "Revive.$"
}

text CeladonCity_DepartmentStore_2F_Text_FloorSign {
    "Top-Grade Items for Trainers!\p"
    "2F: Trainer's Market$"
}

text CeladonCity_DepartmentStore_2F_Text_LanceComesToBuyCapes {
    "We have a customer, Lance, who\n"
    "occasionally comes.\p"
    "He always buys capes.\p"
    "I wonder… Does he have many\n"
    "identical capes at home?$"
}
